Cell["\<\
Notice that we used typeKtemp[[-1]] to return the last element of the \
typeKtemp list. If we try to evaluate the fittedInterpolatingPolynomial \
beyond the original list of temperatures we get an warning the first time it \
is evaluated at that value and it returns a meaningless result.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9493306206511497`*^9, 3.949330750444092*^9}, {
  3.9493414848111067`*^9, 3.949341503502874*^9}, {3.949341539473743*^9, 
